{"about_the_game":"A visual novel depicting a hero called Maks, who is seeking for a waitress which he hasn\u2019t seen for more than a month.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1254280/extras/0742b7fde3a9095aba6205fda5db089c.avif?t=1656777839\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Maks has recently finished his studies and is desperately trying to sort out his life. He visits a bar, \u201cThe Polaroid\u201d, regularly to get drunk and chat with a ginger haired, pretty waitress, which he is afraid to ask out on a date.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1254280/extras/ddd7be36fd0b7e39a959ab057ac6caf3.avif?t=1656777839\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Then one day he doesn\u2019t find her at the bar and decides to go look for her. <br>Intuition brought him to a mystery mansion; a place of gossip and criminal tales. <br>Will Maks find the stranger and unravel the mystery of the cursed mansion?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1254280/extras/b7915ed7c2a759e1b5caf9913ffdb99b.avif?t=1656777839\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><strong>Game features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Detailed description of the main characters - bold red headed Hoshi and modest cute Maks.<br></li><li>An unpredictable storyline with freedom of choice, which can lead to different endings. <br></li><li>Atmospheric music - from classics to modern electric. <br></li><li>Animated \u201clife-like\u201d characters. <br></li><li>An intriguing and touching story, which won\u2019t take more than an hour to finish.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"9e75c58d86287349f16903fe31542bc835657815.jpg","localized_name":"Braveheart","name":"Braveheart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images